  <data name="MessageConfirmAnonymizeAllFiles" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>您想匿名 * 除了这个文件的所有 * 加载的文件吗？</value>
    <comment>Would you like to anonymize *all* loaded files in addition to this one?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmDeleteSelectedTags" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>选定的标记将被删除。 确实要继续吗？</value>
    <comment>The selected tag(s) will be deleted.  Are you sure you want to continue?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmDeleteSelectedTagsFromAllFiles" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>除了选定的文件外, 是否要从 * 所有 * 其他加载的文件中删除选定的标记？</value>
    <comment>Do you want to delete the selected tags from *all* the other loaded files in addition to the one selected?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmReplicateTagsInAllFiles" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>选定的标记及其值将复制到 * 所有 * 加载的文件中。 确实要继续吗？

注: 这不会自动保存文件。您仍然必须单击 "保存" 工具来保存文件。</value>
    <comment>The selected tag(s) and their values will be replicated in *all* loaded files.  Are you sure you want to continue?

NOTE: This will not automatically save the files. You must still click the Save tool to save the files.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmRevert" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>编辑将恢复到上次保存的状态。 确实要继续吗？</value>
    <comment>The edits will be reverted to the last saved state.  Are you sure you want to continue?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmRevertAllFiles" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>是否要还原 * 除此文件之外的所有 * 加载的文件？</value>
    <comment>Would you like to revert *all* loaded files in addition to this one?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmSaveAllFiles" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>所做的更改将保存到 * 所有 * 加载的文件, 原始文件将被覆盖。 确实要继续吗？

注: 如果在 "检查筛选器" 中打开了任何已编辑的文件, 则应将其关闭。否则, 编辑的值可能会显示不变。</value>
    <comment>The changes will be saved to *all* loaded files and the original files will be overwritten.  Are you sure you want to continue?

NOTE: If any of the edited files are open in the Study Filters, it should be closed. Otherwise, the edited values may appear unchanged.</comment>
  </data>
