  <data name="MessageFailedDump" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>dicom 转储操作失败。 所选内容中的文件可能不是Dicom。</value>
    <comment>DICOM Dump operation failed.  File(s) in selection may not be DICOM.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageAnonymizeStudyFailed" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>试图将检查匿名时出错。 请查看日志以了解更多详细信息。</value>
    <comment>An error occurred while attempting to anonymize the study.  Please check the logs for more details.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageNoTagsWereDeleted" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>未删除任何标记。 这通常是因为所选内容仅包含 "序列项"、"序列分隔符项" 和 "无法删除的项"。</value>
    <comment>No tags were deleted.  This is often because the selection only contains Sequence Items, Sequence Delimiter Items, and Item Delimiter Items which cannot be deleted.</comment>
  </data>
