  </data>
  <data name="MessageTagCannotBeCreated" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>无法创建标记。 请确保正确输入的值, 并且适合正在创建的标记。</value>
    <comment>The tag cannot be created.  Please ensure that the values are properly entered and are appropriate for the tag being created.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageUnknownDataSource" xml:space="preserve">
