  <data name="MessageSequenceBinaryReplicationNotSupported" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>不支持复制序列和二进制属性。</value>
    <comment>Replicating sequence and binary attributes is not supported.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageErrorUpdatingSomeFiles" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>保存一个或多个选定文件时出错。 请检查日志, 以确保指定的文件是可访问的, 然后重试。</value>
    <comment>There was an error saving one or more of the selected files.  Please check the logs to make sure the indicated files are accessible and try again.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageAccessionNumberInvalidLength" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>加入编号必须介于0和16个字符之间。</value>
    <comment>The Accession Number must be between 0 and 16 characters.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmSaveSingleFile" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>所做的更改将保存到加载的文件中, 原始文件将被覆盖。确实要继续吗？</value>
    <comment>The changes will be saved to the loaded file and the original file will be overwritten. Are you sure you want to continue?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmSaveSingleRemoteFile" xml:space="preserve">
