  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmKeepReportsAndAttachments" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>dicom 检查附带的报告和其他文档通常包含无法通过此工具完全清除的患者信息。确实要保留这些文件吗？</value>
    <comment>Reports and other documents attached to a DICOM study often contain patient information that cannot be completely cleaned by this tool. Are you sure you want to keep these files?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmAnonymizeOneOrMoreReportsAndAttachments" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>一个或多个匿名文件是报告和/或其他文档。这些通常包含无法通过此工具完全清除的患者信息。确实要继续匿名化吗？</value>
    <comment>One or more files being anonymized are reports and/or other documents. These often contain patient information that cannot be completely cleaned by this tool. Are you sure you want to continue anonymization?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageCannotAnonymizeMaxDiskUsageExceeded" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>由于已超过最大磁盘使用率, 因此无法匿名进行研究。</value>
    <comment>The study cannot be anonymized because the maximum disk usage has been exceeded.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmAnonymizeReportOrAttachment" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>匿名文件是报告或其他文档。这些通常包含无法通过此工具完全清除的患者信息。确实要继续匿名化吗？</value>
    <comment>The file being anonymized is a report or other document. These often contain patient information that cannot be completely cleaned by this tool. Are you sure you want to continue anonymization?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmSaveReportOrAttachment" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>编辑的文件是一个报告和/或其他文档。如果您修改了任何患者信息, 此工具将无法修改文档以匹配您的更改。确实要继续吗？</value>
    <comment>The edited file is a report and/or other document. If you have modified any patient information, this tool cannot modify the document to match your changes. Are you sure you want to continue?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmSaveReportsOrAttachments" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>一个或多个编辑的文件是报告和/或其他文档。如果您修改了任何患者信息, 此工具将无法修改文档以匹配您的更改。确实要继续吗？</value>
    <comment>One or more of the edited files are reports and/or other documents. If you have modified any patient information, this tool cannot modify the document to match your changes. Are you sure you want to continue?</comment>
  </data>
